*.keystore
# ...except this one, which is committed on purpose. Gradle's generated debug
# key differs per machine, so two CI runners would build APKs that cannot
# install over each other. Its password is the well-known "android" and it
# protects nothing. A real signing key never goes in here.
!app/debug.keystore
keystore.properties
